.Nd programmable link-plan API for libelfobj
.Sh LIBRARY
libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft elf_link_plan_t *
.Fn elf_link_plan_create void
.Ft void
.Fn elf_link_plan_destroy "elf_link_plan_t *plan"
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_add_input "elf_link_plan_t *plan" "elfobj_t *obj" "const char *name"
.Ft size_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_input_count "const elf_link_plan_t *plan"
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_set_section_merge_hook "elf_link_plan_t *plan" "elf_link_section_merge_hook_t hook" "void *user"
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_set_archive_hook "elf_link_plan_t *plan" "elf_link_archive_hook_t hook" "void *user"
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_set_gc_hook "elf_link_plan_t *plan" "elf_link_gc_hook_t hook" "void *user"
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_set_incremental_hook "elf_link_plan_t *plan" "elf_link_incremental_hook_t hook" "void *user"
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_set_version_hook "elf_link_plan_t *plan" "elf_link_version_hook_t hook" "void *user"
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_consider_archive_member "elf_link_plan_t *plan" "const char *archive_path" "const char *member_name" "int *should_extract_out"
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_note_incremental "elf_link_plan_t *plan" "const char *key" "const char *value"
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_link "elf_link_plan_t *plan" "elfobj_t **output"
.Ft size_t
.Fn elf_link_plan_map_count "const elf_link_plan_t *plan"
.Ft int
.Fn elf_link_plan_map_entry "const elf_link_plan_t *plan" "size_t index" "elf_link_map_entry_t *out_entry"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The link-plan API provides explicit control over input ordering and policy hooks
for section merge, archive extraction, garbage collection roots,
incremental metadata, and symbol version handling.
.Pp
After inputs and hooks are configured, call
.Fn elf_link_plan_link
to produce a merged output object.
.Pp
Mapping functions expose deterministic input-to-output symbol provenance for
post-link diagnostics and tooling.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn elf_link_plan_create
returns NULL on allocation failure.
.Pp
.Fn elf_link_plan_input_count
and
.Fn elf_link_plan_map_count
return counts.
.Fn elf_link_plan_map_entry
returns non-zero on success and 0 if
.Fa index
is out of range.
.Pp
Other plan APIs return
.Dv ELF_OK
on success and an
.Vt elf_err_t
code on failure.
